  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmiraculixx%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"捐赠徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veinminer-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/625146681182f85ef448f5c910e4cd28ec6cf604.png\" alt=\"连锁采集徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veinminer-hotkey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9badc43c5a3708f90d24088df4f37c03acc943b8.png\" alt=\"客户端徽章\"></a></p><h2>⛏️ 连锁采集附魔</h2><p>著名 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veinminer-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">连锁采集</a> 模组/插件/数据包的扩展，将连锁采集功能限制为全新的自定义附魔 <code>连锁采集</code>！安装此扩展后，仅当拥有该附魔时才能进行连锁采集（仍会遵循方块规则和设置）。</p><p>所有版本同样兼容 <strong>Paper</strong>/<strong>Folia</strong>！<br>\n<strong>数据包</strong>版本可在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fveinminer-enchantment%252fversions%253fl%253ddatapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此处</strong></a>获取</p><h2>⚠ 重要提示</h2><p>此扩展需要同时安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veinminer-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>连锁采集</strong></a> 才能生效！</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1228e4a9540a344e54ac41e6b33a9bb1a63ea33b.png\" alt=\"镐上的连锁采集附魔\"></p><h2>⚙ 设置</h2><p><strong>Fabric/Quilt/NeoForge</strong>：打开jar文件（winrar、7zip等），导航至 <code>data/veinminer-enchantment/enchantment/veinminer.json</code><br>\n<strong>Paper/Folia</strong>：导航至 <code>plugins/veinminer/enchantmentSettings.json</code></p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">ID</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">默认值</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>weight</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">附魔出现频率（数值越高 → 越常见）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>min_cost</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">15</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">附魔台中出现该附魔所需的最低等级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>max_cost</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">65</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">附魔台中该附魔不再出现的最高等级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>anvil_cost</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">7</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">铁砧上合并所需的等级消耗（可与其他附魔叠加）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>附魔名称由可翻译键 <code>enchantment.veinminer-enchantment.veinminer</code> 定义，默认显示为 <code>连锁采集</code>。</p>",
